

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Health Check Endpoint
# Use this to verify your server and Prisma Postgres connection are live
GET {{baseUrl}}/health HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### 2. Initiate JazzCash Mobile Wallet Payment (Sandbox Bypass Success Test)
# This uses the official sandbox number '03123456789' to simulate a successful MPIN entry
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/jazzcash/initiate HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "orderId": "clx1234567890",
    "mobileNumber": "03123456789"
}

###

### 3. Initiate JazzCash Mobile Wallet Payment (Real Number Failure Test)
# This uses a real number which will trigger a 199 error on the sandbox system 
# to test your Prisma database error handling and frontend alert parsing.
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/jazzcash/initiate HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "orderId": "clx1234567891",
    "mobileNumber": "03079035614"
}